      hu: ["A nemzeti park teljes területe körülbelül 89 065 hektár.", "Hivatalosan 1991-ben nyilvánították nemzeti parkká.", "A világ 8 óriáskagyló-faja közül 7 megtalálható a park vizeiben.", "Az Indo-csendes-óceáni térség halfajainak mintegy 70%-a előfordul itt.", "A korallzátonyok több mint 390 különböző korallfajnak adnak otthont.", "A szigetek közötti tengerszakaszok mélysége meghaladja az 1500 métert."],
      ro: ["Parcul acoperă o suprafață totală de aproximativ 89.065 de hectare.", "A fost stabilit oficial ca parc național în cursul anului 1991.", "Găzduiește 7 dintre cele 8 specii de scoici gigant cunoscute în lume.", "Circa 70% din toate speciile de pești din Indo-Pacific trăiesc aici.", "Recifele de corali sunt formate din peste 390 de specii diferite.", "Adâncimea apei între insulele parcului poate depăși 1.500 de metri."],
      en: ["The park covers a total area of approximately 89,065 hectares.", "It was officially established as a national park in 1991.", "Seven of the world's eight species of giant clams are found here.", "About 70% of all known fish species in the Indo-Western Pacific live in the park.", "The coral reefs host over 390 distinct species of coral.", "The waters between the islands reach depths of over 1,500 meters."],
